<title>USA: Latin American Casinos sets special div.</title>
<headline>Latin American Casinos sets special div.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH MIAMI BEACH, Fla. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latin American Casinos Inc said Wednesday it had declared a special dividend of $0.05 per share for shareholders of record May 30. No payment date has been set.</p>
<p>The company said its officers and directors had waived payment of the dividend to themselves.</p>
</text>
